# =============================================================================
#  12061 / 12601 Control Systems - inverted pendulum lab
# =============================================================================

# ---- Build output -----------------------------------------------------------
.pio/
build_gcc/
*.o
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.map

# ---- Editor state that is specific to ONE machine ---------------------------
# c_cpp_properties.json and launch.json embed absolute paths such as
# C:/Users/<name>/.platformio/... - they are regenerated by PlatformIO on
# every machine and are wrong everywhere else. extensions.json is portable
# (it only recommends the PlatformIO extension) and IS tracked on purpose.
.vscode/.browse.c_cpp.db*
.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
.vscode/launch.json
.vscode/ipch/

# ---- MATLAB ------------------------------------------------------------------
*.asv
*.autosave
*.slxc
slprj/
MATLAB_Code/slprj/

# ---- Lab captures ------------------------------------------------------------
# Every student run writes .mat/.csv here. It is their data, not repository
# content, and it would collide between groups.
MATLAB_Code/Labs/*/data/
MATLAB_Code/Labs/*/*_Data/
MATLAB_Code/Lab*_Data/

# ---- Staff-only notes --------------------------------------------------------
# CHANGES.md is the Chinese porting log: what changed relative to the WHEELTEC
# original and why. Useful to whoever maintains the firmware, not to students.
# README.md is deliberately NOT ignored - it is the repository landing page.
CHANGES.md
readme-repo.md

# ---- OS / OneDrive junk ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.bak
~$*
